# Three Tree Mascot: "{1}: Add one mana of any color. Activate only once each turn." Turn 1: Mox Jet and Mox Pearl cast it; Mox Ruby's
# {R} pays the first {1} and the Mascot adds {G} (a color other than the one spent). With Mox Sapphire's mana available a
# second activation the same turn is refused (CR 602.5b). On turn three it can be activated again, now for {W}, and it
# cannot be activated for colorless.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Three Tree Mascot
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Three Tree Mascot.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Three Tree Mascot.Activate(Color: Colorless)
Bot1.Battlefield.Three Tree Mascot.Activate(Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Three Tree Mascot.Activate(Color: Blue)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Three Tree Mascot.Activate(Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {W}
